1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,594
1822 mein Sanchi stupa ko khazane ke liye cheera gaya.

2
00:00:03,594 --> 00:00:07,547
Ek angrez afsar ne gumbad ke upar se khudai shuru karwayi.

3
00:00:07,547 --> 00:00:11,501
Use laga, andar sona chandi chhupa hoga. Mazdoor patthar hatate gaye,

4
00:00:11,501 --> 00:00:12,938
gaddha gehra hota gaya.

5
00:00:12,938 --> 00:00:15,814
Par woh beech tak pahunch hi nahi paaya.

6
00:00:15,814 --> 00:00:17,970
Aur kaam adhoora chhodkar chala gaya.

7
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:21,582
Us afsar ka naam tha Herbert Maddock, ek British political agent.

8
00:00:21,582 --> 00:00:24,866
Yeh baat Alexander Cunningham ne apni kitaab mein darj ki.

9
00:00:24,866 --> 00:00:27,821
Gumbad mein bada ghaav ban gaya, patthar bikhar gaye.

10
00:00:27,821 --> 00:00:29,791
Jo stupa sadiyon se khada tha,

11
00:00:29,791 --> 00:00:31,761
woh ek lalach se ghayal hua.

12
00:00:31,761 --> 00:00:34,060
Aur sawaal yahin se shuru hota hai.

13
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:37,093
Kya is stupa ke beech mein Buddha ki asthiyan thi?

14
00:00:37,093 --> 00:00:39,216
Asthiyan yaani jalne ke baad bachi haddiyan,

15
00:00:39,216 --> 00:00:40,732
jo pavitra maani jaati hain.

16
00:00:40,732 --> 00:00:44,068
Ya yeh gumbad bina kisi avshesh ke hi banaya gaya tha?

17
00:00:44,068 --> 00:00:46,191
Aaj tak koi yakeen se nahi jaanta.

18
00:00:46,191 --> 00:00:48,617
Is video mein hum sabut ke saath chalenge,

19
00:00:48,617 --> 00:00:49,830
ek ek parat kholkar.

20
00:00:49,830 --> 00:00:53,954
Yeh kahani ek pahadi ki hai, Madhya Pradesh ke Sanchi ki.

21
00:00:53,954 --> 00:00:56,203
Pehle dekhenge granth kya kehte hain.

22
00:00:56,203 --> 00:00:59,577
Phir dekhenge khudai mein kya mila. Aur aakhir mein,

23
00:00:59,577 --> 00:01:01,827
vidwan kahan aapas mein asahmat hain.

24
00:01:01,827 --> 00:01:05,201
Har panel par ek chip dikhega. Usse pata chalega,

25
00:01:05,201 --> 00:01:08,200
yeh granth hai, sabut hai ya sirf kahani.

26
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:12,233
Pehle samjhiye, stupa hota kya hai. Stupa yaani ek gol gumbad,

27
00:01:12,233 --> 00:01:15,899
jiske andar pavitra avshesh rakhe jaate hain. UNESCO ke mutabik,

28
00:01:15,899 --> 00:01:18,831
Sanchi ka bada stupa Samrat Ashok ne banwaya.

29
00:01:18,831 --> 00:01:21,398
Yeh 3rd century BCE ki baat hai,

30
00:01:21,398 --> 00:01:23,597
yaani Isa se bhi sadiyon pehle.

31
00:01:23,597 --> 00:01:26,530
Shuruaat mein yeh eenton ka ek gumbad tha.

32
00:01:26,530 --> 00:01:28,291
Ab chaliye granth ki taraf.

33
00:01:28,291 --> 00:01:31,109
Sri Lanka ka ek purana granth hai, Mahavamsa.

34
00:01:31,109 --> 00:01:34,983
Yeh wahan ke rajaon aur Buddh dharm ka itihaas likhta hai.

35
00:01:34,983 --> 00:01:36,744
Isme ek prem kahani hai.

36
00:01:36,744 --> 00:01:39,914
Yuva Ashok safar par Vidisha shehar mein ruke the.

37
00:01:39,914 --> 00:01:42,380
Woh ek vyapari ke ghar mehmaan bane.

38
00:01:42,380 --> 00:01:43,553
Mahavamsa kehta hai,

39
00:01:43,553 --> 00:01:47,070
wahin Ashok ne vyapari ki beti se vivah kiya.

40
00:01:47,070 --> 00:01:51,370
Uska naam tha Devi, granth use kulin mahila kehta hai. Vidisha,

41
00:01:51,370 --> 00:01:55,278
Sanchi se bahut paas ka shehar hai. Granth ke mutabik,

42
00:01:55,278 --> 00:01:58,014
Devi ne Vedisagiri par ek vihar banwaya.

43
00:01:58,014 --> 00:02:00,750
Vihar yaani bhikshuon ke rehne ki jagah.

44
00:02:00,750 --> 00:02:04,918
Granth ka Vedisagiri aaj ke Sanchi ke paas maana jaata hai.

45
00:02:04,918 --> 00:02:09,087
Toh kahani mein ek raja hai, ek vyapari ki beti hai.

46
00:02:09,087 --> 00:02:12,497
Aur ek pahadi hai jahan shaanti basti thi. Socho,

47
00:02:12,497 --> 00:02:16,286
bahut purani ek shaam, pahadi par diye jal rahe hain.

48
00:02:16,286 --> 00:02:18,560
Bhikshu chupchaap dhyan mein baithe hain.

49
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:21,221
Yahan se ek lok kahani judti hai.

50
00:02:21,221 --> 00:02:25,023
Gaon ke log kehte hain, Ashok ne Sanchi isliye chuna.

51
00:02:25,023 --> 00:02:29,205
Kyonki yahi woh pahadi thi jahan unka Devi se vivah hua.

52
00:02:29,205 --> 00:02:32,247
Par dhyan rakhiye, yeh sirf lok kahani hai.

53
00:02:32,247 --> 00:02:36,049
Maurya kaal ka koi shilalekh Devi ko yahan nahi dikhata.

54
00:02:36,049 --> 00:02:38,330
Shilalekh yaani patthar par khuda sandesh.

55
00:02:38,330 --> 00:02:40,711
Toh granth ek prem kahani sunata hai.

56
00:02:40,711 --> 00:02:43,773
Lok kahani use shaadi ki jagah bana deti hai.

57
00:02:43,773 --> 00:02:47,175
Aur patthar abhi tak chup hain. Yahi farq yaad rakhiye,

58
00:02:47,175 --> 00:02:50,237
poori video mein kaam aayega. Ab ek aur granth,

59
00:02:50,237 --> 00:02:53,639
jo ek aur badi baat kehta hai. Ek aisi sankhya,

60
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:55,340
jo sunkar sar ghoom jaaye.

61
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:59,257
Yeh granth hai Ashokavadana, Sanskrit mein likhi Ashok ki katha.

62
00:02:59,257 --> 00:03:03,173
Avadana yaani punya ke kaamon ki kahani. Isme likha hai,

63
00:03:03,173 --> 00:03:05,915
Ashok ne Buddha ke avshesh ikattha karwaye.

64
00:03:05,915 --> 00:03:09,440
Yeh avshesh 7 purane stupon mein rakhe hue the.

65
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:11,790
Ashok ne un stupon ko khulwaya.

66
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:14,643
Phir granth kehta hai, sone, chandi,

67
00:03:14,643 --> 00:03:17,973
crystal aur lajward ki dibbiyan banwayi gayi.

68
00:03:17,973 --> 00:03:21,302
Lajward yaani ek gehra neela keemti patthar.

69
00:03:21,302 --> 00:03:24,631
Avsheshon ko in dibbiyon mein baanta gaya.

70
00:03:24,631 --> 00:03:28,911
Aur poore samrajya mein 84,000 stupa banwaye gaye. Socho,

71
00:03:28,911 --> 00:03:32,240
ek hi raja, aur itne saare stupa.

72
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,789
Yaad rakhiye, yeh granth ki baat hai,

73
00:03:34,789 --> 00:03:36,974
isliye chip par likha hai scripture.

74
00:03:36,974 --> 00:03:39,158
Granth ek bhavya tasveer dikhata hai.

75
00:03:39,158 --> 00:03:43,164
Par sankhya ka sabut granth ke bahar dhoondhna padta hai. Haan,

76
00:03:43,164 --> 00:03:47,897
Sanchi ka eenton wala purana gumbad Ashok ke zamane ka maana jaata hai.

77
00:03:47,897 --> 00:03:50,810
Yahan granth aur patthar ek jagah milte hain.

78
00:03:50,810 --> 00:03:54,603
Ab sawaal yeh hai, itna bada stupa kho kaise gaya?

79
00:03:54,603 --> 00:03:58,016
Kyonki ek zamane mein Sanchi ko log bhool gaye.

80
00:03:58,016 --> 00:04:01,051
Pahadi par jhaadiyan ug aayin, patthar gir gaye.

81
00:04:01,051 --> 00:04:03,706
Aur phir aaye ek angrez ghudsawar afsar.

82
00:04:03,706 --> 00:04:06,740
Yahan se shuru hoti hai khoj ki kahani.

83
00:04:06,740 --> 00:04:09,000
ASI yaani Bharatiya Puratattva Survekshan.

84
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:13,521
Yeh sarkari sanstha purani dharohar sambhalti hai. ASI ke mutabik,

85
00:04:13,521 --> 00:04:18,493
Sanchi sadiyon tak veeran pada raha. Na koi pooja karne aata,

86
00:04:18,493 --> 00:04:23,466
na koi dekhbhaal karta. Phir 1818 mein General Taylor yahan pahunche.

87
00:04:23,466 --> 00:04:26,630
Woh British ghudsawar fauj ke afsar the.

88
00:04:26,630 --> 00:04:27,021
Socho,

89
00:04:27,021 --> 00:04:31,321
ghode par ek afsar jhaadiyon ko hatata hua upar chadhta hai.

90
00:04:31,321 --> 00:04:34,840
Saamne ek vishal gol gumbad, aadha mitti mein dhanka.

91
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:37,576
Aas paas tute khambe aur nakkashidaar darwaze.

92
00:04:37,576 --> 00:04:40,313
Taylor ne is jagah ko darj kiya.

93
00:04:40,313 --> 00:04:43,440
Aur duniya ki nazar phir Sanchi par padi.

94
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:46,483
Par nazar padna hamesha achha nahi hota.

95
00:04:46,483 --> 00:04:51,266
Kuch angrez aise bhi aaye, jinhe itihaas nahi, khazana chahiye tha.

96
00:04:51,266 --> 00:04:55,614
Aur phir aaya 1822, jiska zikr humne shuru mein kiya.

97
00:04:55,614 --> 00:04:59,961
Herbert Maddock ne gumbad mein upar se gehri khudai karwayi.

98
00:04:59,961 --> 00:05:02,570
Maqsad tha, andar chhupa khazana nikalna.

99
00:05:02,570 --> 00:05:05,975
Cunningham ne baad mein likha, yeh khudai bhadde tareeke se hui.

100
00:05:05,975 --> 00:05:08,142
Gumbad mein bada sa ghaav ban gaya.

101
00:05:08,142 --> 00:05:11,238
Bahar ki patthar ki parat bhi kai jagah dhah gayi.

102
00:05:11,238 --> 00:05:14,643
Aur sabse ajeeb baat, Maddock beech tak pahunch hi nahi paaya.

103
00:05:14,643 --> 00:05:16,500
Woh kaam adhoora chhodkar chala gaya.

104
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:19,712
Ab socho, agar beech mein sach mein asthiyan thi.

105
00:05:19,712 --> 00:05:22,567
Toh kya woh is khudai mein bikhar gayi?

106
00:05:22,567 --> 00:05:25,422
Ya woh aaj bhi gumbad ke andar hain?

107
00:05:25,422 --> 00:05:27,920
Ya wahan kabhi kuch tha hi nahi?

108
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:31,489
Yeh sawaal hum aakhir mein phir uthayenge. Pehle dekhte hain,

109
00:05:31,489 --> 00:05:33,630
toota stupa phir khada kaise hua.

110
00:05:33,630 --> 00:05:36,382
Toota hua stupa, bikhre patthar, aur jungle.

111
00:05:36,382 --> 00:05:39,526
Kai saal tak Sanchi aise hi pada raha.

112
00:05:39,526 --> 00:05:44,636
Phir ek angrez puratattvavid aur Bhopal ki ek begum ne milkar kaam uthaya.

113
00:05:44,636 --> 00:05:48,960
Yeh is kahani ka sabse sukoon bhara hissa hai. Dekhiye kaise.

114
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:51,339
Unka naam tha Sir John Marshall,

115
00:05:51,339 --> 00:05:54,510
us waqt Bharat mein puratattva vibhag ke mukhiya.

116
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:58,078
Puratattva yaani zameen se mili purani cheezon ka vigyan.

117
00:05:58,078 --> 00:06:02,042
1912 mein Marshall ne Sanchi par vyavasthit kaam shuru kiya.

118
00:06:02,042 --> 00:06:05,610
Vyavasthit yaani naap jokh kar, record banakar, dheere dheere.

119
00:06:05,610 --> 00:06:09,326
Is kaam ka paisa diya Bhopal ki Sultan Jahan Begum ne.

120
00:06:09,326 --> 00:06:12,704
Ek shasak ne apni dharohar bachane ke liye khazana khola.

121
00:06:12,704 --> 00:06:14,731
Ab is ulte pher ko dekhiye.

122
00:06:14,731 --> 00:06:17,095
Ek ne khazane ke liye stupa toda.

123
00:06:17,095 --> 00:06:19,460
Doosre ne stupa ke liye khazana diya.

124
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:23,641
Marshall ki team ne gire hue pattharon ko ek ek karke pehchana.

125
00:06:23,641 --> 00:06:27,125
Toote hisson ko jodkar gumbad ko phir se majboot kiya.

126
00:06:27,125 --> 00:06:29,912
Jo bikhra tha, use uski jagah lautaya gaya.

127
00:06:29,912 --> 00:06:33,396
Conservation yaani jo bacha hai, use aur girne se bachana.

128
00:06:33,396 --> 00:06:34,790
Yeh kaam saalon chala.

129
00:06:34,790 --> 00:06:38,654
Aur 1919 mein Marshall ne yahan ek puratattva museum bhi banaya.

130
00:06:38,654 --> 00:06:39,707
ASI ke mutabik,

131
00:06:39,707 --> 00:06:42,869
wahi aage chalkar aaj ka Sanchi site museum bana.

132
00:06:42,869 --> 00:06:46,732
Matlab Sanchi ki kahani dekhne ke liye aapko door nahi jaana.

133
00:06:46,732 --> 00:06:48,840
Yeh baat aakhir mein kaam aayegi.

134
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:51,111
Ab stupa ko dhyan se dekhiye.

135
00:06:51,111 --> 00:06:54,518
Andar Ashok ke zamane ka eenton wala gumbad hai.

136
00:06:54,518 --> 00:06:58,682
Baad mein uske upar patthar ki ek moti parat chadhayi gayi.

137
00:06:58,682 --> 00:07:02,467
UNESCO ke mutabik, isse stupa ki chaudai kaafi badh gayi.

138
00:07:02,467 --> 00:07:04,739
Jaise purane ghar par plaster nahi,

139
00:07:04,739 --> 00:07:07,010
poori nayi deewar chadha di jaaye.

140
00:07:07,010 --> 00:07:09,739
Aaj iska vyas 36.6 metre hai.

141
00:07:09,739 --> 00:07:14,741
Vyas yaani ek kinaare se doosre kinaare tak ki seedhi doori.

142
00:07:14,741 --> 00:07:18,379
Aur gumbad ki oonchai lagbhag 16.5 metre hai.

143
00:07:18,379 --> 00:07:22,927
Yaani ek oonchi imaarat jitna. Itna bada gumbad, bina cement,

144
00:07:22,927 --> 00:07:27,020
bina machine. Sochiye, kitne haathon ne patthar dhoye honge.

145
00:07:27,020 --> 00:07:30,034
Ab stupa ke aas paas ke darwaze dekhiye.

146
00:07:30,034 --> 00:07:33,801
Inhe torana kehte hain, yaani nakkashidaar patthar ka mukhya dwar.

147
00:07:33,801 --> 00:07:37,945
In par kahaniyon ke drishya khude hain, haathi, ped, raja, nagar.

148
00:07:37,945 --> 00:07:41,336
Dakshini darwaze par Brahmi lipi mein ek lekh hai.

149
00:07:41,336 --> 00:07:44,350
Brahmi yaani Bharat ki ek bahut purani lipi.

150
00:07:44,350 --> 00:07:47,246
Woh lekh ek chaukane wali baat batata hai.

151
00:07:47,246 --> 00:07:51,227
Yeh nakkashi Vidisha ke haathi daant ke kaarigaron ne ki thi.

152
00:07:51,227 --> 00:07:55,209
Haathi daant par baarik kaam karne wale log, patthar par utre.

153
00:07:55,209 --> 00:07:59,190
Shayad isiliye yeh nakkashi itni naazuk lagti hai. Jaise patthar nahi,

154
00:07:59,190 --> 00:08:01,000
kisi ne daant taraasha ho.

155
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,359
Dakshini darwaze ke paas ek aur sabut khada hai,

156
00:08:04,359 --> 00:08:08,465
Ashok ka khamba. Is par Ashok ka ek edict khuda hai.

157
00:08:08,465 --> 00:08:12,571
Edict yaani raja ka likhit farmaan, jo sabke liye hota tha.

158
00:08:12,571 --> 00:08:13,691
ASI ke mutabik,

159
00:08:13,691 --> 00:08:17,050
yeh farmaan Sangha mein phoot ke khilaaf chetavni hai.

160
00:08:17,050 --> 00:08:21,104
Sangha yaani bhikshuon aur bhikshuniyon ka samooh. Farmaan kehta hai,

161
00:08:21,104 --> 00:08:25,564
jo bhikshu ya bhikshuni Sangha ko todega, use bahar kiya jaayega.

162
00:08:25,564 --> 00:08:30,024
Socho, ek samrat patthar par likhwa raha hai, ekta banaye rakho.

163
00:08:30,024 --> 00:08:35,700
Yeh woh jagah hai jahan granth aur shilalekh dono Ashok ka naam lete hain.

164
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:38,425
Ab aate hain sabse dilchasp behas par.

165
00:08:38,425 --> 00:08:41,539
Darwazon ki nakkashi mein ek ajeeb baat hai.

166
00:08:41,539 --> 00:08:45,042
Kai drishyon mein Buddha ka sharir dikhta hi nahi.

167
00:08:45,042 --> 00:08:49,324
Unki jagah sirf nishaan hain. Khaali singhasan, bina sawaar ka ghoda,

168
00:08:49,324 --> 00:08:51,270
pairon ke nishaan, ek chakra.

169
00:08:51,270 --> 00:08:55,605
Vidwan Alfred Foucher ka kehna tha, yeh jaan boojhkar kiya gaya.

170
00:08:55,605 --> 00:08:59,547
Unke mutabik, Buddha ka sharir banane par dharmik rok thi.

171
00:08:59,547 --> 00:09:01,912
Isliye kalakaron ne sirf nishaan banaye.

172
00:09:01,912 --> 00:09:04,276
Is soch ko aniconism kehte hain.

173
00:09:04,276 --> 00:09:07,823
Aniconism yaani pooja ke roop ko murti mein nahi,

174
00:09:07,823 --> 00:09:09,400
sirf sanket se dikhana.

175
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:11,423
Phir aayi kala itihaaskar Susan Huntington.

176
00:09:11,423 --> 00:09:14,796
Unhone yeh baat Art Journal ke ek lekh mein rakhi.

177
00:09:14,796 --> 00:09:15,807
Unka kehna tha,

178
00:09:15,807 --> 00:09:18,843
yeh Buddha ke jeevan ke drishya hain hi nahi.

179
00:09:18,843 --> 00:09:20,866
Yeh us zamane ke log hain,

180
00:09:20,866 --> 00:09:23,227
jo pavitra jagahon par pooja karne aaye.

181
00:09:23,227 --> 00:09:25,250
Yaani patthar par teerthyatra ka drishya.

182
00:09:25,250 --> 00:09:28,825
Toh ek hi panel, do alag padhaai. Foucher kehte hain,

183
00:09:28,825 --> 00:09:32,400
yahan Buddha hain, bas dikhaye nahi gaye. Huntington kehti hain,

184
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:35,975
yahan bhakt hain, ek pavitra jagah ki pooja karte hue.

185
00:09:35,975 --> 00:09:39,193
Dono bade vidwan hain, dono ke paas tark hain.

186
00:09:39,193 --> 00:09:40,980
Faisla aaj bhi khula hai.

187
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:44,253
Ab us sawaal par lautte hain jahan se shuru kiya tha.

188
00:09:44,253 --> 00:09:47,228
Kya bade stupa ke beech mein Buddha ki asthiyan thi?

189
00:09:47,228 --> 00:09:49,905
Granth kehte hain, Ashok ne avshesh stupon mein baante.

190
00:09:49,905 --> 00:09:54,070
Par bade stupa ke beech se aisa koi sabut aaj hamare saamne nahi hai.

191
00:09:54,070 --> 00:09:57,721
Do raaste hain, aur dono khule hain. Pehla, asthiyan thi,

192
00:09:57,721 --> 00:10:01,007
jo angrez zamane ki shauqiya khudaiyon mein kho gayi.

193
00:10:01,007 --> 00:10:05,023
Shauqiya yaani bina training ke, sirf shauk ya lalach mein khodna.

194
00:10:05,023 --> 00:10:09,039
Doosra, yeh gumbad bina kisi sharirik avshesh ke hi banaya gaya.

195
00:10:09,039 --> 00:10:11,960
Shayad yeh yaad aur shraddha ka smarak tha.

196
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,115
Ek aur baat.

197
00:10:13,115 --> 00:10:18,892
Aas paas ke chhote stupon mein Buddha ke shishyon ke avshesh ki dibbiyan mili hain.

198
00:10:18,892 --> 00:10:20,818
Shishya yaani unke kareebi chele.

199
00:10:20,818 --> 00:10:24,284
Toh is pahadi par avshesh rakhne ki parampara thi,

200
00:10:24,284 --> 00:10:25,439
yeh saaf hai.

201
00:10:25,439 --> 00:10:29,290
Bas bade stupa ka dil abhi bhi ek raaz hai.

202
00:10:29,290 --> 00:10:32,468
Toh agar aap Sanchi jaayein, toh kya dekhein?

203
00:10:32,468 --> 00:10:36,043
Yeh jagah Madhya Pradesh mein hai, Vidisha ke paas.

204
00:10:36,043 --> 00:10:41,207
UNESCO ne ise World Heritage yaani vishwa dharohar ki suchi mein rakha hai.

205
00:10:41,207 --> 00:10:45,180
Matlab poori duniya ise insaaniyat ki saajhi virasat maanti hai.

206
00:10:45,180 --> 00:10:48,904
Sabse pehle bada stupa, aur uske paas ke nakkashidaar darwaze.

207
00:10:48,904 --> 00:10:52,257
Dakshini darwaze par woh Brahmi lekh dhoondhiye, kaarigaron wala.

208
00:10:52,257 --> 00:10:55,609
Paas mein Ashok ke khambe ki jagah bhi dekhiye.

209
00:10:55,609 --> 00:10:59,333
Darwazon ke drishyon ko dhyan se dekhiye. Khaali singhasan dikhe,

210
00:10:59,333 --> 00:11:03,430
toh khud sochiye. Aap Foucher ke saath hain ya Huntington ke?

211
00:11:03,430 --> 00:11:07,454
Phir site museum zaroor jaaiye, jiski neev Marshall ne rakhi thi.

212
00:11:07,454 --> 00:11:10,380
Wahan khudai ki cheezein aapko kareeb se dikhengi.

213
00:11:10,380 --> 00:11:12,575
Aur ek pal ruk kar sochiye.

214
00:11:12,575 --> 00:11:14,770
Ek angrez ne yahan khazana dhoondha,

215
00:11:14,770 --> 00:11:17,697
ek begum ne yahan khazana lagaya. Wahi pahadi,

216
00:11:17,697 --> 00:11:19,160
do bilkul alag niyat.

217
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:22,980
Ab aapki baari. Humne granth dekhe, lok kahani suni,

218
00:11:22,980 --> 00:11:27,649
aur khudai ke sabut dekhe. Humne dekha vidwan kahan asahmat hain.

219
00:11:27,649 --> 00:11:31,894
Ab sawaal aapse hai, aur jawab aapki samajh ka hai.

220
00:11:31,894 --> 00:11:35,290
Koi sahi galat nahi, bas aapki apni soch.

221
00:11:35,290 --> 00:11:41,489
Agli baar hum chalenge samundar ke neeche, Dwarka ki khoj par.

222
00:11:41,489 --> 00:11:43,179
Wahan gotakhor hain,

223
00:11:43,179 --> 00:11:48,251
yaani paani ke andar utarkar khoj karne wale log.

224
00:11:48,251 --> 00:11:52,196
Wahan bhi granth hain aur behas bhi.

225
00:11:52,196 --> 00:11:57,267
Tab tak comment mein bataiye. Aapko kya lagta hai,

226
00:11:57,267 --> 00:12:03,466
Sanchi stupa ke beech mein Buddha ki asthiyan thi ya nahi?
